    {
      "id": "946acbe0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 条件语句\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "344c2b6b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## if和else语句\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f96a46c1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**条件语句**允许根据逻辑表达式的值来决定代码的某些部分是否执行或跳过。`if` –`else`条件结构的语法如下。\n\n```\nif logical_expression\n    actions_1\nelse\n    actions_2\nend\n```\n\n如果`logical_expression`计算结果为`true`，则执行操作序列`action_1`。如果`logical_expression`计算结果为`false`，则执行操作序列`action_2`。条件语句结构由强制关键字`end`结束。\n\n例如，让我们比较两个数值`x`和`y`。如果它们相等，则屏幕上会显示消息“x等于y”。否则（即`x`不等于`y`时），则显示消息“x不等于y”。执行这些操作的代码如下所示：\n\n```\nif x == y\n    println(\"x equals y\")\nelse\n    println(\"x is not equal to y\")\nend\n```\n\n\n如果条件表达式`x == y`的计算结果为`true`，则执行相应的代码块；否则，执行`else`代码块。以下是其实际工作原理。让我们创建一个函数`compare(x,y)`，用于比较两个参数`x`和`y`：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf84196c",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function compare(x, y)\r\n    if x == y\r\n        println(\"x equals y\")\r\n    else\r\n        println(\"x is not equal to y\")\r\n    end\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
