    {
      "id": "acc4e448",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "编写一个函数`even_odd`，该函数接受整数`n`作为输入，并返回一条文本消息，指示该数是偶数还是奇数。然后分别以$4$、$5$、$-4$和$-5$作为参数调用该函数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "212e4d9e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
