    {
      "id": "94d68ff9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 7,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a90ea1a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "请记住，判断一个数是否为偶数的方法如下：若该数除以$2$后的余数为0，则该数为偶数；否则，该数为奇数。计算数`n`除以$2$后的余数方法如下：`mod(n,2)`。在函数声明中，需指定输入数据类型（`Int`）：`function even_odd(n::Int)`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "067f1cf0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 5,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "209e4f15",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function even_odd(n::Int)\r\n    if mod(n,2) == 0\r\n        println(n, \" even\")\r\n    else\r\n       println(n, \" odd\")\r\n    end   \r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
