    {
      "id": "1cb34148",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  `elseif`语句\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f4d12dee",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在`if`之后，可以使用另一个条件语句`elseif`，以指定后续代码块执行的附加条件。\r\n\r\n```\r\nif logical_expression_1\r\n    actions_1\r\nelseif logical_expression_2\r\n    actions_2\r\nelse \r\n    actions_3\r\nend\r\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09d097aa",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "让我们修改上一例中的`compare`函数。我们将比较两个数值：`x`和`y`。如果它们相等，则在屏幕上显示消息“x等于y”；否则，如果`x > y`，则显示消息“x大于y”。最后，如果未满足最后一个条件（即`x < y`），则显示消息“x小于y”。 \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a656b999",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function compare(x, y)\r\n    if x == y\r\n        println(\"x equals y\")\r\n    elseif x > y\r\n        println(\"x is greater than y\")\r\n    else \r\n        println(\"x is less than y\")\r\n    end\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
