    {
      "id": "7296ccd5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "编写一个函数`translate`，该函数有一个名为`s`的文本类型输入参数，该参数取以下值之一：`\"one\"`、`\"two\"`、`\"three\"`、`\"four\"`或`\"five\"`。该函数返回输入单词的法语翻译。如果参数取值与上述指定值不符，该函数将返回文本消息：`\"I can't translate\"`。接下来，请通过传入参数值`\"one\"`、`\"three\"`和`\"six\"`来测试此函数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
