    {
      "id": "af9e64d6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n条件结构是“开放”的，即它们不形成局部范围。这意味着在条件结构内定义的新变量可以在结构之后使用，甚至这些变量此前未被定义过。因此，上文所示的`compare`函数可以定义如下：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1e9d236",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function compare(x,y)\r\n    if x == y\r\n        relation = \"equal to\"\r\n    elseif x > y\r\n        relation = \"more\"\r\n    else\r\n        relation = \"less\"\r\n    end\r\n    println(\"x \", relation, \" y\")\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f7cbefcb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "变量`relation`虽在条件结构内部声明，但被用于其外部。不过，使用此特性时，必须为代码的每条可能执行路径都定义该变量的值。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edf83bb4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 使用条件语句的实际示例\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3fb80b09",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "举例来说，我们考虑函数**，它用于计算阶乘**，并使用了条件语句。该函数接收一个整数参数`n`。随后会检查两个条件：如果$n<0$，则无法计算负数的阶乘，此时会在屏幕上显示一条错误信息；如果$n=0$，则执行$n!=1$；否则，使用公式$n!=n \\cdot (n-1)$计算阶乘。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dee27d3e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function fact(n::Int)\r\n    if n < 0\r\n        return \"n must be non-negative\"\r\n    elseif n == 0\r\n        return n = 1\r\n    else\r\n        return n*fact(n-1)\r\n    end    \r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4bdffaf5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "让我们通过将该函数的参数分别设置为$-1$、$0$和$5$来测试该函数：\n\n"
