    {
      "id": "7cb7f666",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 5,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0d2fa383",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "对于直角三角形，毕达哥拉斯定理成立：$a^2+b^2=c^2$。由于我们不知道哪一边是斜边、哪两边是直角边，因此可以通过依次将三角形的三条边分别设为斜边，来验证该等式是否成立。如果至少有一种情况下该等式成立，则该三角形为直角三角形。最方便的做法是使用逻辑“或”运算符将这三个条件合并为一个条件。该条件将如下所示：\r\n\r\n```\r\nif a^2+b^2 == c^2 || b^2+c^2 == a^2 || a^2+c^2 == b^2\r\n```\r\n\r\n如果该条件不成立，则该三角形不是直角三角形。因此，在条件语句中，你只需要`if`和`else`这两条语句。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5812ef66",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8956e5e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function right(a,b,c)\r\n    if a^2+b^2 == c^2 || b^2+c^2 == a^2 || a^2+c^2 == b^2\r\n        println(\"the triangle is a right-angled triangle\")\r\n    else\r\n        println(\"the triangle is not a right-angled triangle\")    \r\n    end    \r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
